'''Royal Barrage''' (王国砲壊, ''Ōkoku Hōkai'', '''Collapsing Kingdom''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 15.1 Update|Version 15.1]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Unit Attack Up (M): Cats' attack power increases by 15%.

